 As Model 1 moves toward the background, Model 2 emerges from the rear stage area, striding forward down the opposite side of the runway. They pass each other smoothly in a staggered cross-over path under bright overhead beams.\n- From 00:06.500 to 00:10.000: Model 2 reaches the front mark as Model 1 vanishes into the background light. Model 2 pauses, placing her right hand on her hip and resting her left hand down to showcase the shattered-glass dress details. The camera captures her in a stunning close-up before she executes a sharp spin and begins her exit walk toward the glowing \"MISS UNIVERSE\" screen.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThumping electronic fashion runway beat, sharp heels clicking distinctly on the glass catwalk, intense camera shutter pops, subtle fabric rustle from the fur coat and metallic dress, and soft ambient audience murmur.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
